cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Interpretable Machine Learning for Caco-2 Permeability Prediction"
message: "If you use this software or workflow in your research, please cite this repository."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Asghar"
    given-names: "Moneeba"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Moneebaasghar/admet-drug-discovery-ml"

abstract: >
  Reproducible and interpretable machine-learning workflow for Caco-2
  permeability prediction using RDKit molecular descriptors, Morgan
  fingerprints, Random Forest regression, cross-validation, out-of-fold
  prediction, SHAP analysis, and statistical interpretation of molecular
  fingerprint environments.

keywords:
  - ADMET
  - Caco-2
  - drug discovery
  - cheminformatics
  - computational chemistry
  - molecular machine learning
  - QSAR
  - RDKit
  - explainable AI
  - SHAP

license: MIT
year: 2026
